### Local-only collection. Supply tokens/invite in your client's private environment.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

GET {{base}}/api/v1/health/ready

### Register (choose a unique synthetic address)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"reviewer@example.invalid","password":"replace with private test password","displayName":"Reviewer"}

### Login; keep accessToken in memory/private client variables
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"reviewer@example.invalid","password":"replace with private test password"}

### Create; generate a fresh UUID for each logical command
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{commandId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"destination":"Bengaluru, India","startDate":"2026-11-10","endDate":"2026-11-14","totalBudget":"10000.00","currency":"INR","maxParticipants":8}

### Join using a second account token
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trips/join
Authorization: Bearer {{participantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{commandId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"inviteCode":"{{inviteCode}}"}

### Mandatory catalog example
GET {{base}}/api/v1/destinations/Bengaluru%2C%20India/venues?near=12.9716,77.5946&radiusKm=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save group ceiling while Leader is connected by WebSocket
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/constraints
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"commandId":"{{commandId}}","correlationId":"{{correlationId}}","expectedStateVersion":{{stateVersion}},"categoryCeilingsMinor":{"food":50000}}

### Mandatory Concierge example; request ceiling only tightens saved ceiling
POST {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/ai/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{commandId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Suggest synthetic food near our activity","category":"food","startTime":"2026-11-10T06:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-10T07:30:00Z","ceilingMinor":50000}

### Admin-only read; ordinary Leader/Planner must receive 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/datasets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin stages a validated local JSON payload; set datasetJson privately
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/datasets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{{datasetJson}}

### Full authoritative snapshot / analytics
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/planning
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

GET {{base}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
